                        <div class="context">
                        
                <p>April 21, 2022 — Energy efficiency upgrades financed through GoGreen Home Energy Financing have averted the greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions equivalent of 3.4 million vehicle miles. Read the <a href="/sites/default/files/2025-12/10_0.pdf" target="_blank">press release</a> from the Office of State Treasurer Fiona Ma.</p>
